       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PAYMENT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 GROSS PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01 FEE PIC 9(2)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01 NET PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01 RETURN-CODE PIC 9 VALUE ZERO.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           ACCEPT GROSS
           CALL 'FEE-SERVICE' USING BY CONTENT GROSS
               BY REFERENCE FEE RETURNING RETURN-CODE
           END-CALL
           COMPUTE NET = GROSS - FEE
           DISPLAY NET
           GOBACK.
